sde (0.1.0~alpha12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the black screen after login in virtual machines: the compositor
    uses XRender (no blur) in VirtualBox, VMware, QEMU/KVM and Hyper-V, and
    sde-session replaces a compositor that draws a black screen (XRender,
    then off). Alt+Shift+F12 and "sde-session --compositor" toggle it.
  * Autostart no longer starts a second compositor (picom.desktop etc.).
  * New debion-desktop-base package: DebION wallpaper, lock screen, login,
    GRUB background, vendor logos and Plymouth splash as the active
    desktop-base theme; the LightDM greeter uses the DebION login artwork.
  * Fix a possible Action Center crash on unusual drive labels and a
    compositor restart that ended pre-alpha12 sessions.

 -- Hugo Moniz do Rego <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0900

sde (0.1.0~alpha11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Four GTK 3/GTK 4 themes in /usr/share/themes: SDE Light, SDE Dark,
    SDE Aero and SDE Liquid Glass, each with SDE WM frames.
  * Start Menu: reliable search (no XIM, focus retry), Settings and session
    results, right-click Arrange menu, grid view and animations.
  * Ported from Eduka-Desktop: Effects page with compositor modes, report and
    restart; Action Center drives and power modes.
  * Liria SDE Tools extension and polished native application styling.

