sde (0.1.0~alpha2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the black screen when a component cannot start: session log in
    ~/.local/state/sde/session.log, a rescue dialog and "sde-session --check".
  * Panel: quick settings (Wi-Fi/Ethernet, volume, mute, output device,
    brightness, battery, Do Not Disturb), calendar, pin/unpin by right-click,
    drag to reorder, top or bottom position, auto-hide.
  * StatusNotifierItem/AppIndicator tray with dbusmenu, next to XEmbed.
  * New sde-notifyd: org.freedesktop.Notifications with action buttons.
  * Settings: interface size 100-200 %, Displays (xrandr with automatic
    revert), Keyboard & Mouse, Notifications pages; "sde-settings --apply".
  * Desktop: combined Windows/Linux context menu (View, Sort by, Refresh,
    New, terminal, file manager) and shortcuts F5, F2, Delete, Ctrl+Shift+N.
  * Keyboard focus rings, WCAG contrast checks, gettext translations.
  * Lower memory use: icon lookups no longer keep directory listings.

